    "updated_at": "2023-12-12T16:20:52Z",
    "body": "One other use case: If I wish for an application to cache the compressed response data with a custom storage layer, it would have been convenient if the application could take the data as encoded by the server and push it into the cache directly. At the moment, one can only grab the data in its decompressed form, which would either waste space in the cache or require the application to re-compress it.",
